sert|Desserts]]\n\nThese are traditional chewy chocolate chip cookies with oatmeal added to provide a bit of extra body to the cookie.\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n*1 stick [[Cookbook:butter|butter]], softened \n*⅓ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] white granulated [[Cookbook:sugar|sugar]] \n*½ cup [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:egg|egg]] \n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Vanilla Extract|vanilla extract]] \n*½ tsp [[Cookbook:salt|salt]] \n*½ tsp [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]] \n*1 cup plus 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:flour|flour]] \n*¼ cup [[Cookbook:rolled oats|rolled oats]] (oatmeal)\n*½ cup [[Cookbook:chocolate chip|chocolate chips]] \n\n==Procedure==\n#Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 375°F.\n#[[Cookbook:Creaming|Cream]] together butter and sugars. \n#Add egg and vanilla and mix. \n#Add salt, baking soda, and flour; mix. \n#Mix in oatmeal.\n#Mix in chocolate chips.\n#Scoop cookies onto a greased or [[Cookbook:Parchment Paper|parchment]]-lined [[Cookbook:Baking Sheet|baking sheet]].\n#Bake 9–11 minutes at 375°F.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chocolate]]\n[[Category:Recipes for oatmeal cookies]]\n[[Category:Recipes using oat]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with images]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Oatmeal Chocolate Chip Cookies III","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 stick butter, softened","sourceText":"1 stick butter, softened","amountText":"1 stick butter, softened","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"⅓ cup white granulated sugar","sourceText":"⅓ cup white granulated sugar","amountText":"⅓ cup white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"